msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Scrobbles what you watch in Kodi and syncs your library with Trakt"
msgstr "Scrobble tontonan Anda di Kodi dan sinkronkan pustaka Anda dengan Trakt"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Trakt Relay scrobbles the movies, episodes, live TV and recordings you watch in Kodi to Trakt, and syncs your library with it: collection, watched status, ratings and playback progress, each direction switched on in the settings. It asks for a rating after you watch, and its context menu rates, adds to the watchlist and starts a rewatch of a show. Scrobbles that fail are retried later.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay is a modified version of script.trakt by Trakt.tv, Razzeee and its contributors."
msgstr "Trakt Relay melakukan scrobble film, episode, TV langsung, dan rekaman yang Anda tonton di Kodi ke Trakt, serta menyinkronkan pustaka Anda dengannya: koleksi, status tonton, rating, dan progres pemutaran, masing-masing arah diaktifkan di pengaturan. Relay meminta rating setelah Anda menonton, dan menu konteksnya dapat memberi rating, menambahkan ke daftar tonton, dan memulai tonton ulang sebuah acara. Scrobble yang gagal akan dicoba ulang nanti.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay adalah versi modifikasi dari script.trakt oleh Trakt.tv, Razzeee, dan para kontributornya."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Trakt Relay is not affiliated with or endorsed by Trakt."
msgstr "Trakt Relay tidak berafiliasi dengan atau didukung oleh Trakt."

